msgid "迟响天梯"
msgstr "Echoes Rising"

msgid "回应迟迟才到，我踩准迟来的回响"
msgstr "The world answers late. I move when the echo arrives."

msgid "继续游戏"
msgstr "Continue"

msgid "新游戏"
msgstr "New Game"

msgid "设置"
msgstr "Settings"

msgid "退出游戏"
msgstr "Quit"

msgid "暂停"
msgstr "Paused"

msgid "返回主菜单"
msgstr "Main Menu"

msgid "语言"
msgstr "Language"

msgid "音乐音量"
msgstr "Music Volume"

msgid "音效音量"
msgstr "Sound Volume"

msgid "全屏"
msgstr "Fullscreen"

msgid "窗口分辨率"
msgstr "Window Resolution"

msgid "保存并返回"
msgstr "Save & Return"

msgid "1K 1920×1080"
msgstr "1K 1920×1080"

msgid "2K 2560×1440"
msgstr "2K 2560×1440"

msgid "4K 3840×2160"
msgstr "4K 3840×2160"

msgid "按 E 交谈"
msgstr "Press E to Talk"

msgid "图集齿轮"
msgstr "Atlas Gear"

msgid "守梯人"
msgstr "The Keeper"

msgid "花园守梯人"
msgstr "Garden Keeper"

msgid "钟楼守梯人"
msgstr "Tower Keeper"

msgid "星空守梯人"
msgstr "Sky Keeper"

msgid "当前 %.1f m    最高 %.1f m"
msgstr "Current %.1f m    Best %.1f m"

msgid "恭喜登顶"
msgstr "Summit Reached"

msgid "空格 / W 继续"
msgstr "Space / W to Continue"

msgid "空格 / W 结束"
msgstr "Space / W to Finish"

msgid "ESC 关闭"
msgstr "ESC to Close"

msgid "平台"
msgstr "Platform"

msgid "桥"
msgstr "Bridge"

msgid "门"
msgstr "Door"

msgid "弹簧"
msgstr "Spring"

msgid "%s 即将出现 %.1f 秒"
msgstr "%s appears in %.1f s"

msgid "%s 即将消失 %.1f 秒"
msgstr "%s disappears in %.1f s"

msgid "%s 剩余 %.1f 秒"
msgstr "%s: %.1f s left"

msgid "%s 即将恢复 %.1f 秒"
msgstr "%s returns in %.1f s"

msgid "%s 等待玩家离开"
msgstr "%s: waiting for player to move"

# 索引 0
msgid "欢迎来到迟响天梯。\n先学会移动和跳跃，再一路向上。"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Echoes Rising.\n"
"Learn to move, then climb."

msgid "A/D 或 ←/→ 移动，\nW/↑/空格 跳跃。\n按住时间越久，跳得越高。"
msgstr ""
"A/D or ←/→ to move.\n"
"W/↑/Space to jump.\n"
"Hold longer to jump higher."

msgid "掉下去不会死，\n但每次都得重新爬。\n踩稳了再跳。"
msgstr ""
"Falling will not kill you,\n"
"but you must climb again.\n"
"Land well before you leap."

msgid "前面的弹簧会把你弹高，\n记得从正上方踩下去，\n祝你一路顺风。"
msgstr ""
"The spring ahead will launch you high.\n"
"Land on it from above.\n"
"Good luck."

# 索引 1
msgid "来到这里说明你已经学会了基础操作，\n从这里开始，\n某些回应会慢一步。"
msgstr ""
"You have mastered the basics.\n"
"From here on,\n"
"some answers arrive late."

msgid "踩下蓝色按钮，\n迟来的平台或弹簧会出现。"
msgstr ""
"Step on a blue button.\n"
"A delayed platform or spring will appear."

msgid "等迟来的机关出现，\n看清位置，再踏出下一步。"
msgstr ""
"Wait for the late mechanism.\n"
"Read its position before you move."

msgid "机关回应期间，\n重复踩下不会重置时间。\n等回应结束，下一次踩下才生效。"
msgstr ""
"While a mechanism is responding,\n"
"stepping on the button again will not reset its timer.\n"
"Wait for the response to end; the next press will then take effect."

# 索引 2
msgid "踩下红色按钮，\n挡路的门会迟一步打开，\n过一会儿又恢复原状。"
msgstr ""
"Step on a red button.\n"
"The door opens a beat later,\n"
"then closes again."

msgid "按钮只是开端，\n看清机关的先后顺序，\n让迟来的回应彼此接力。"
msgstr ""
"The button is only the beginning.\n"
"Read the sequence,\n"
"and let each late answer carry the next."

# 索引 3
msgid "登顶的最后一程没有新的机关，\n只有紧凑的路线和更准的落点。"
msgstr ""
"The final ascent adds no new devices,\n"
"only tighter routes and more precise landings."

msgid "熟悉过的跳跃、弹簧和按钮，\n会在这里接连回应你。"
msgstr ""
"The jumps, springs, and buttons you know\n"
"will answer one after another."

msgid "这里没有多余的空间，\n看清节奏，一次踩准。"
msgstr ""
"There is no room for error.\n"
"Read the rhythm. Land it in one try."

msgid "回应迟迟才到，\n你必须在它到来前，先迈出下一步。"
msgstr ""
"The answer arrives late.\n"
"You must take the next step before it comes."

# 索引 4
msgid "恭喜！"
msgstr "Congratulations!"

msgid "恭喜你走到这里。\n踩上最后的弹簧，\n让一路迟来的回响，\n一起送你登顶。"
msgstr ""
"You made it this far.\n"
"Take the final spring,\n"
"and let every late echo\n"
"carry you to the summit."

# 索引 5
msgid "你来了。"
msgstr "You made it."

msgid "这一路，\n你踩准的不只是机关，\n还有它们迟来的回响。"
msgstr ""
"Along the way,\n"
"you landed not only on mechanisms,\n"
"but on their late echoes."

msgid "有些答案没有立刻出现，\n但你走过的路，\n一直都在。"
msgstr ""
"Some answers did not appear at once,\n"
"but the path you walked\n"
"was always there."

msgid "做过的从来不是无用功，\n只是在成为回响之前，\n它需要一点时间。"
msgstr ""
"Nothing you did was wasted.\n"
"It only needed time\n"
"to become an echo."

msgid "回响终于追上了你，\n而你也已经走到了这里。"
msgstr ""
"The echo has finally caught up with you,\n"
"and you have already made it here."
